{{!
    @template local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_known

    What a family that was already known sees when it signs up again (j.php, $existed): not the end of a form, but the wall
    of the centre with the things of the children they just wrote already hanging from the rail, as on their own page, and
    the visit they signed up for with who receives them. Their page itself is not shown here, since whoever filled in the
    form might not be that family: its link went to the address the centre already had (text). Only what they just wrote
    and the act are shown.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * i - icons: mail, phone
    * title, names - «Ya están apuntados» and the names used at home just written, joined («Leo y Ana»), or ''
    * text - pub_known_sent, or pub_known_nomail when there was no address
    * rail - the pegs as public_pegs takes them (count, came, live, pegs), from the children just written
    * hall, json, base - the hall of skin A behind the wall, as on the page of a family, or false
    * event - the act (lead as the page of a family says it, weekday, daymonth, name, hours, place), or false from w.php
    * expect - pub_known_expect («Los esperamos»)
    * hashosts, hosts (name, role, photo, initials), receives - who receives them, as on the page of a family
    * email, phone, tel, writeus - as public_message

    Example context (json):
    {
        "i": {"mail": "", "phone": ""}, "title": "Ya están apuntados", "names": "Leo y Ana",
        "text": "Ya los conocíamos: les hemos mandado el enlace a su página al correo que nos dieron la otra vez.",
        "rail": {"count": 2, "came": false, "live": false, "pegs": [{"index": 0, "name": "Leo", "style": "--reposo:-3.5deg",
            "object": "mochila", "arriving": true, "stuck": false, "hidden": false}, {"index": 1, "name": "Ana",
            "style": "--reposo:3deg", "object": "mochila", "arriving": true, "stuck": false, "hidden": false}]},
        "hall": false,
        "event": {"lead": "El <b>sábado 21 de noviembre</b> los recibe Lucía.", "weekday": "Sábado",
            "daymonth": "21 de noviembre", "name": "Jornada de puertas abiertas", "hours": "De 10:00 a 13:00",
            "place": "Entrada principal"},
        "expect": "Los esperamos", "hashosts": true, "receives": "Quién los recibe",
        "hosts": [{"name": "Lucía Medina", "role": "Tutora", "photo": "", "initials": "LM"}],
        "email": "admisiones@example.com", "phone": "+34 900 000 000", "tel": "+34900000000", "writeus": "Escribirnos"
    }
}}
{{#hall}}
<div class="sala-familia" data-vestibulo data-escena="{{json}}" data-base="{{base}}" aria-hidden="true"><div class="sala"></div></div>
{{/hall}}
<section class="pared conocidos{{#hall}} con-sala{{/hall}}" aria-labelledby="titulo">
    <div class="saludo-arriba">
        <h1 class="titular" id="titulo">{{title}}{{#names}}, <span class="mano-titular" translate="no" dir="auto">{{names}}</span>{{/names}}</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="riel" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="heroe-ancho">
        {{#rail}}{{> local_oksigeniaeguahe/public_pegs }}{{/rail}}
        <div class="bajo-riel">
            {{#event}}<p class="entradilla">{{{lead}}}</p>{{/event}}
            <div class="aviso en-heroe conocidos-correo" role="status">
                <span class="icono">{{{i.mail}}}</span>
                <p>{{text}}</p>
            </div>
            <div class="acciones">
                {{#email}}<a class="boton secundario" href="mailto:{{email}}">{{{i.mail}}}{{writeus}}</a>{{/email}}
                {{#phone}}<a class="enlace" href="tel:{{tel}}" dir="ltr">{{{i.phone}}}{{phone}}</a>{{/phone}}
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{{#event}}
<section class="seccion dos-col conocidos-visita" aria-labelledby="conocidos-visita-t">
    <div class="cabeza">
        <h2 id="conocidos-visita-t">{{expect}}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="conocidos-cuerpo">
        <div class="invitacion-acto">
            <p class="invitacion-acto-fecha"><span>{{weekday}}</span> <b>{{daymonth}}</b></p>
            <p class="invitacion-acto-que"><b>{{name}}</b><span>{{hours}}{{#place}} · {{place}}{{/place}}</span></p>
        </div>
        {{#hashosts}}
        <div class="conocidos-reciben">
            <h3>{{receives}}</h3>
            <ul class="conocidos-caras">
                {{#hosts}}
                <li class="persona-lleva">{{#photo}}<img class="retrato" src="{{photo}}" alt="">{{/photo}}{{^photo}}<span class="retrato ini" aria-hidden="true">{{initials}}</span>{{/photo}}<span><b>{{name}}</b>{{#role}}<span class="papel" dir="auto">{{role}}</span>{{/role}}</span></li>
                {{/hosts}}
            </ul>
        </div>
        {{/hashosts}}
    </div>
</section>
{{/event}}
